					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-391272#post-1261702</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-391272/origin-of-clef#post-1261702</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 19 Sep 2011 07:33:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>thedeadlymoose</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>732274</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is excellent. Upvoted.</p> <p>That said, there's some places that need polish.</p> <blockquote> <p>He immediately hit the floor as a hail of bullets passed through the area he'd just been standing in.</p> </blockquote> <p>This sentence is pretty damn awkward.</p> <blockquote> <p>He crawled on his belly towards the good doctor's desk, even as Mann continued firing wildly, yelling the entire time.</p> </blockquote> <p>We don't need 'yelling the entire time', since you have the yelling directly after. Similarly&#8230;</p> <blockquote> <p>&quot;I DON'T CARE WHAT SCP-001 IS! I DON'T WANT TO KNOW WHAT THE ORIGIN OF THE FOUNDATION IS! WOULD YOU PEOPLE JUST LEAVE ME ALONE!&quot; Mann, a little unhinged,</p> </blockquote> <p>We can see he's a little unhinged, so you don't need to tell us that.</p> <blockquote> <p>Assigned me to some of the anomalous skips, that we didn't know what they were.</p> </blockquote> <p>This is also an awkward sentence, and I don't think Clef speaks that clumsily (though I could be wrong; if I am, this gets the 'dialogue pass').</p> <blockquote> <p>I made sure I was their top agent, Ukelele.</p> </blockquote> <p>Grammatically, this sounds like the GOC's top agent is always called Ukelele. Is this the case?</p> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Alto…Why?&quot;</p> </blockquote> <p>This is a bad line. It's overused cliche of a line for one, and it doesn't make sense in context. Almost any other line would be preferable.</p> <p>The bullet spraying and hiding under the desk and the ranting are a bit excessively silly - I would have preferred it if it was more realistically played. Would make Mann's reaction have more impact (or, well, any impact beyond a chuckle). On the other hand, this is the least of my recommendations - it actually works fine for me, I just think it would have <em>more</em> impact done otherwise.</p> <p>But yeah, I think this idea is great, and the idea that Clef = Bright is entertaining to no end (whether or not I believe it). And Clef coming to fuck with Mann after the O5s tell him all these Sekrits is also a great idea.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
